 To change who has access, use `PUT /:account_slug/boards/:board_id` with the `user_ids` parameter.
+
+## Publication
+
+Publishing a board creates a secret link. Anyone with that link can view the board, its columns, and its published cards without signing in. Draft cards stay private. Only board administrators (account admins and the board creator) can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes the board. Publishing again keeps the same secret link.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board in the same shape as `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id`. `public_url` is the secret link:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "name": "Fizzy",
+  "all_access": true,
+  "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+  "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+  "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "public_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/public/boards/pX27zsMN2ViQKta1bGfLmVJE",
+  "creator": {
+    "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+    "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+    "role": "owner",
+    "active": true,
+    "email_address": "david@example.com",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes the board. The previous secret link stops working. Deleting a publication that does not exist still returns success.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content`.
+
+### Public pages
+
+These routes do not require authentication:
+
+- `GET /public/boards/:key` shows the published board
+- `GET /public/boards/:key/columns/:id` shows a column and its active cards
+- `GET /public/boards/:key/cards/:number` shows a published card
+
+These are reached at `/:account_slug/public/boards/:key` when the request includes an account slug, and also work at `/public/boards/:key`.
+
+`public_url` is `null` until the board is published.
diff --git a/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/boards/publications_controller_test.rb
